{"author":"carlo.cifarelli@gmail.com","body":"Added ti list --parent <id>: lists the direct sub-issues of a ticket. Added parent to Filter with the apply check, and included it in the relationship-filter bypass so children (which have a parent) are surfaced even though sub-issues are hidden by default. Threaded through SavedView (serde default for back-compat) and the TUI's current_saved_view. Unit test + CLI test."}